Package: m6APrediction
Title: Predict RNA N6-Methyladenosine Sites Using Random Forests
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Zixiao",
    family = "Feng",
    email = "Zixiao.Feng24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts RNA N6-methyladenosine site probabilities and
    classification statuses using a pretrained random forest model.
    Supports batch prediction from feature tables and prediction for
    individual sites using sequence context, transcript annotations,
    structural features, and evolutionary conservation. Includes a
    fitted model and example input data for demonstrating package use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    randomForest,
    stats
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
